{"id":"01_5944","type":"item","name":{"ja":"HG 1/100 VF-31J ジークフリード (ハヤテ･インメルマン機)","en":"HG 1/100 VF-31J Siegfried (Hayate Immelman machine)"},"description":[{"ja":"差替三段変形やシリーズ初のインサート成形により、ハイクオリティと組み立てやすさを両立した「VF-31J ジークフリード（ハヤテ・インメルマン機）」が登場！","en":"Introducing the \"VF-31J Siegfried (Hayate Immelman machine)\" which combines high quality and ease of assembly with three-stage replacement and insert molding for the first time in the series!"},{"ja":"• 一部に差し替えパーツを使用することで変形シークエンスを簡略化する「差替三段変形（ショートカットチェンジ）」を採用。HGシリーズならではの組み立てやすさと広い可動域、各形態の洗練されたフォルムを実現。","en":"• Adopts \"replacement three-stage transformation (shortcut change)\" that simplifies the transformation sequence by using some replacement parts. The ease of assembly, wide range of motion, and sophisticated form of each form that are unique to the HG series are realized."},{"ja":"• 変形機構の一部に差し替えパーツを取り入れたことで、変形シークエンスの簡略化を実現。バトロイド、ガウォーク、ファイターへの簡単変形が可能。","en":"• By incorporating replacement parts into part of the transformation mechanism, the transformation sequence has been simplified. Can be easily transformed into Battroid, Gerwalk, and Fighter."},{"ja":"• 「差替三段変形（ショートカットチェンジ）」の採用により、設定画をイメージした各形態のフォルムを追求。","en":"• By adopting \"replacement three-stage transformation (shortcut change)\", we pursue the form of each form based on the image of the setting image."},{"ja":"• 複雑な構造を除外し、ポージングを意識した最適な可動ポイントを設けることで新次元の可動性能を実現。","en":"• A new dimension of movable performance has been achieved by eliminating complicated structures and creating optimal movable points with posing in mind."},{"ja":"• HG『マクロス』プラモデルシリーズ初の「インサート成形」を採用。色分けが複雑な部分もパーツを切り離すだけで再現し、ハイクオリティと組み立てやすさを両立。","en":"• Adopts \"insert molding \" for the first time in the HG \" Macross\" plastic model series. Parts with complex color coding can be reproduced by simply separating the parts, achieving both high quality and ease of assembly."},{"ja":"• コンテナユニットはパーツの差し替えで格納状態を再現。","en":"• Container unit can reproduce storage condition by replacing parts."},{"ja":"• ミニガンポッドは軸可動で前方に展開可能。","en":"• The mini gun pod can be deployed forward with a movable axis."},{"ja":"• ナイフ2本に加え、パイロットフィギュア２種とフレイア・ヴィオンのフィギュアとマルチドローン型の台座が付属。","en":"• In addition to 2 knives, 2 types of pilot figures, a Freya Vion figure, and a multi-drone type pedestal are included."},{"ja":"• 表情豊かなハンドパーツが付属し様々なポージングを表現可能。","en":"• Comes with expressive hand parts that allow you to express various poses."},{"ja":"• 偏光成形を使用したキャノピーは開閉が可能。","en":"• Canopy using polarized molding can be opened and closed."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"ナイフ×2","en":"Knife x 2"},{"ja":"ランディングギア×1式","en":"Landing gear x 1 set"},{"ja":"ファイター形態再現用パーツ×1式","en":"Fighter form reproduction parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"ジョイントパーツ×1","en":"Joint parts x 1"},{"ja":"ハンドパーツ×1式","en":"Hand parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"フィギュア×3種","en":"Figures x 3 types"},{"ja":"フィギュア用台座×1","en":"Figure pedestal x 1"},{"ja":"シール×1","en":"Seal×1"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/548qfQAOxQqg0XJB/aB6mZxbyNyeU8m1H.jpeg?Expires=1765044113&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=RCk4LTY3BowzicUBK-USY70lQhnt-r962fGM76kgaM1PY~kOR2p03QRzAppChkfBwf~~LU2S2or~GhuTQ1fJeVxhGCamyj8ZNnbbFcLjz4o81N3IXflNF9KR1eJZwze~ARfUi6pQuvtUcEXFRaMBqECNuymkPWchbonGhIvUaUEHnC5aDA7jmgTcMzRJhOhBNQjbdKeA0eNydzlHManZbJ6Sb06jNhWFJAcNT-YyEBRR8NsqkFKL24Gd1hkchlXBHTRKQveUDmIz-rm5qXKUoNIXHGcl9FHSCm0mYmz~0totP~uRQzuTdHDs0dzgL5fO-TifzMrA8RFKYv0chQ25MQ__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/voGHp3slINV5zcXC/EFoor70rQNoK43em.jpeg?Expires=1765044113&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=JI67n846vmcqp5K-INSsm7GyJAi5FAMfkiN1FORAlC69NIjCZMgnpsv9HaUcu1xzMH1VBan2UAoVgzCbU1Elgx1Cx9PIy-MQ8lWQOaew5LwRM5Q0ovVJn9hTkdYdllQ4v8ewhk3ZM37jPfCB39gkRvNnY6tc5y6Pn0Ra~A3AF73xTzuZTmdnu-x52cJvdKdxhvc5E6MyjUjfKbGaXK7xZBWzVnD8RSHOpG5-6Ez4m5vk7QEkbowIKgZNKHaBg6G7dcaD2wo2dMWAThB-qjiBfWrB6mIy-xdiE9yc8amrMc8vUaP2D23-pZr6WaPo2ODG~mrw14bJxq5guYXFb~dpHA__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/wdx19jvslvUKXXTx/a